Capture hook for the replay-parity spike (native/replay-core, RUST-PLAN.md §1).

Adds a TS_REPLAY_DUMP-gated dump call to PortfolioSingleIntraNodeSolver's
parallelReplayStep, immediately after runReplayRace() returns — the exact
point where all candidate trajectories are complete and the live TS replay
winner is known. 15 added lines, one file, zero behavior change when the env
var is unset. The heavy lifting lives in native/replay-core/captureDump.ts
(lazy require, so the main build gains no import edge).

Apply from the worktree root (/home/pullin/personal/awt-perf-stack):

    git apply native/replay-core/capture-hook.patch

Revert:

    git apply -R native/replay-core/capture-hook.patch

